<title>UK: All six Brent dates kept on Friday.</title>
<headline>All six Brent dates kept on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>All six Brent dates turning wet on Friday were kept by the equity holders, trade sources said.</p>
<p>Two Jan 25-27 loading cargoes were kept by BP and Koch, two Jan 26-28 loading cargoes were kept by J.P. Morgan and BP and Two 27-29 loading cargoes were kept by BP and Dreyfus.</p>
<p>-- Colin Wooster, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
